{"ticker":"BABA","updated":"2026-10-23T22:40:07Z","profile":{"longName":"Alibaba Group Holding Limited","shortName":"Alibaba Group Holding Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Internet Retail","country":"China","website":"https://www.alibabagroup.com","fullTimeEmployees":132165,"marketCap":247878909952,"trailingPE":24.125908,"forwardPE":10.723723,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.23721129,"pegRatio":0.47,"targetMeanPrice":187.01158,"targetHighPrice":239.9584,"targetLowPrice":95.89721,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":40,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.086,"earningsGrowth":-0.794,"grossMargins":0.38199002,"operatingMargins":0.07295,"profitMargins":0.07039,"totalRevenue":1044970995712,"beta":0.463,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":182.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":91.99,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.03},"summary":"Alibaba Group Holding Limited, through its subsidiaries, provides technology infrastructure and marketing reach to help merchants, brands, retailers, and other businesses in the People's Republic of China and internationally. It operates through the Alibaba China E-Commerce Group, Alibaba International Digital Commerce Group, Cloud Intelligence Group, and All Others segments. The Alibaba China E-commerce Group segment operates Taobao and Tmall, which are digital retail platforms; Taobao Instant Commerce, a local services and on-demand delivery platform; 1688.com, a domestic wholesale marketplace; and Xianyu, a consumer-to-consumer community and marketplace for idle goods. Its Alibaba International Digital Commerce Group segment includes AliExpress, a global e-commerce platform; Trendyol, an e-commerce platform in Turkey; Lazada, an e-commerce platform in Southeast Asia; Daraz, an e-commerce platform in South Asia, primarily in Pakistan and Bangladesh; and Alibaba.com, an integrated international online wholesale marketplace. The Cloud Intelligence Group segment offers a suite of cloud services based on infrastructure-as-a-service, platform-as-a-service, and model-as-a-service. Its All Others segment comprises Amap, a provider of mobile digital maps, navigation, and real-time traffic information in China; Cainiao, which provides logistics solutions; Youku, an online long-form vi","summary_zh":"阿里巴巴集團控股有限公司透過其子公司提供技術基礎設施和行銷覆蓋範圍，以幫助中華人民共和國和國際上的商家、品牌、零售商和其他企業。它透過阿里巴巴中國電子商務集團、阿里巴巴國際數位商務集團、雲端智慧集團和所有其他部門進行營運。阿里巴巴中國電子商務集團部門經營淘寶和天貓這兩個數位零售平台；淘寶即時商務，本地服務和按需配送平台； 1688.com，國內批發市場；閒魚是一個消費者對消費者的社區和閒置商品市場。其阿里巴巴國際數位商務集團部門包括全球電子商務平台速賣通； Trendyol，土耳其電子商務平台； Lazada，東南亞電商平台； Daraz，南亞電商平台，主要在巴基斯坦和孟加拉國；以及綜合國際線上批發市場阿里巴巴。雲端智慧集團部門提供一套基於基礎設施即服務、平台即服務和模式即服務的雲端服務。其所有其他部門包括高德地圖（Amap），一家在中國提供移動數字地圖、導航和實時交通資訊的提供商；菜鳥，提供物流解決方案；優酷，一個在線長影片","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"網路零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":125.18,"h":126.73,"l":123.5,"c":124.35,"v":12888400},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":125.295,"h":126.0,"l":123.72,"c":124.19,"v":8706100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":121.2,"h":122.515,"l":120.79,"c":122.23,"v":13833100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":119.53,"h":121.25,"l":117.6,"c":119.57,"v":14501100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":128.88,"h":136.65,"l":128.51,"c":135.0,"v":82165100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":134.47,"h":138.83,"l":133.06,"c":138.55,"v":41625400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":136.7,"h":137.77,"l":135.58,"c":136.45,"v":16470500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":133.16,"h":134.25,"l":130.06,"c":130.92,"v":24730900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":135.03,"h":135.61,"l":132.7,"c":135.58,"v":19202500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":139.88,"h":141.22,"l":138.769,"c":141.2,"v":20095300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":145.4,"h":148.0,"l":144.65,"c":147.1,"v":32792300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":145.42,"h":145.92,"l":143.23,"c":143.93,"v":21079900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":148.12,"h":156.849,"l":147.86,"c":155.44,"v":50089200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":154.07,"h":155.46,"l":152.06,"c":155.06,"v":20903300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":159.09,"h":159.7,"l":156.73,"c":158.04,"v":23567200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":158.36,"h":163.0,"l":157.59,"c":162.21,"v":26017700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":166.0,"h":167.32,"